#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/movement-at-a-glance.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Charging units and evading units move at up to full pace. [.bo5a]#Units in# "
"regular formations of columns or straight lines move at up to full pace "
"unless fortified.  Fortified units and units in an irregular formation move "
"at up to half pace."
